> [It] took three[ overt]imes, but No. 16-[ranked] St. Thomas held off a hot-shooting host Augsburg team[ Saturday] in conference men's basketball play in Minneapolis. The T[oms] rode freshman[ guard] Anders Nelson's heroics to win 112-105.
